      "message": "not necessarily: if you know you are going to insert a timestamp during the call of the motion_sense task, no need to insert several timestamp. For instance:\n\n\n+-----\n| sensor 1 datum\n+-----\n| TS\n+-----\n| sensor 2 datum\n+-----\n| TS\n+-----\n| sensor 3 datum\n+-----\n| TS\n+-----\nis equivalent to\n\n+-----\n| sensor 1 datum\n+-----\n| sensor 2 datum\n+-----\n| sensor 3 datum\n+-----\n| TS\n+-----\nThe later save spaces.",
