      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a problem if you have append to process 2 samples or more here (unlikely but possible):\nYou will have\n+------------\n| datum 1\n+------------\n| last_interrupt_timestamp\n+------------\n| datum 2\n+------------\n| last_interrupt_timestamp\n+------------\n\nCTS will complain there is no gap between datum 1 and 2.\n\nyou want\n+------------\n| datum 1\n+------------\n| datum 2\n+------------\n| last_interrupt_timestamp\n+------------\n\ncros ec ring will insert a gap; it will be erroneous as the gap will be less than the ODR would have predicted, but we will pass CTS tests.",
